o. [Volume] 50ml *É Separado do conjunto especial 1+1 enviado da nossa sede e é enviado individualmente embalado sem caixa externa. Reembolsos e devoluções não são possíveis devido a isso. #Korean Cosméticos Cosméticos #KBeleza #good Produto do produto #good Preço #round Laboratório ——————————————————————————————————————————————————————— ————— 🩶Três promessas de koksara.kbeauty 1.Confeccionamos desinfecção três vezes por semana.√ 2.Vendemos 100% genuíno.√ 3.Tempo de carregamento: Todo o tempo [24/7].√ ——————————————————————————————————————————————————————— ————— round lab birch moisture ampoule 50ml (no case only product) shipping from korea [Product details] Charge for 7 seconds, keep moisture for 3 days! FLEX-SOME Particle softening technology is applied to make the formulation particles soft and flexible, helping them to be more thoroughly absorbed into the skin. 72-hour moisture lasting, strong moisture retention 4-layer moisturizing layering from the outside to the inside Contains the refreshing moisture of Inje birch to keep you moisturized all day long. Inje birch sap, grown with the refreshing energy of the cool breeze, is rich in amino acids and minerals and supplies moisture to dry blood to keep the skin moist. 10-layer hyaluronic acid provides dense moisture from the outside to the inside. 10 types of hyaluronic acid consisting of high, medium, and low molecules deeply fill the skin with moisture from the outside to the inside, creating a non-dry skin. Non-drying moisturizing with glyceryl glucoside that opens the moisture path. ‘Resurrection plant’ with strong vitality that survives even in the dry desert Glyceryl glucoside, a key ingredient in resurrection plant, helps provide strong moisture by activating aquaporin, a water channel in the skin. Powerful moisturizing effect with patented moisturizing ingredients Aquaxyl, a patented moisturizing ingredient that combines glucose and xylitol derived from birch and beech trees, replenishes skin moisture and